  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Hello? This is Central Power Authority. This is not a local trip. Your whole sector's grid is down, so your booth panel won't fix it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Go to the [[power station]] and open the [[fuse box]]. The fuses have blown. Find replacements, put them in, then pull the main lever.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ae68bc6a03601b448bb9bc0c8f8bb57, type: 2}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Until then your whole block stays dark. Move quickly.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
